WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000 size:90%
I used to arrive with questions in my
head and forget them as soon as the
conversation began.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000 size:90%
Before my next visit, I tucked a short
list into the book I carried with me.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000 size:90%
Having those words on paper helped me
explain what worried me and ask what I
could expect.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000 size:90%
I also made space to talk about what
mattered in my day-to-day life.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000 size:90%
I still take my questions with me.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000 size:90%
Feeling able to ask them is part of
how I keep moving forward.
